### =E2=80=A2 A. Prepare Tool Module (7-Zip Format)

1. **Create folder structure** for the tool:
   ```
   Anhdv_VM_Tools\
   =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 VBox\
   =E2=94=82   =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 VBoxService.exe
   =E2=94=82   =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 drivers\
