       =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 vmtoolsd.exe
       =E2=94=94=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 drivers\
   ```

2. **Compress to `.7z`**:
   ```
   Anhdv_VM_Tools.7z
   ```

3. (Optional) Add a launcher script inside:
   ```
   RunVMTools.cmd
   ```

   Example:
   ```cmd
   @echo off
   :: Detect VM environment and run corresponding tools
   systeminfo | findstr /i "VMware" &gt;nul &amp;&amp; start vmtoolsd.exe
   systeminfo | findstr /i "VirtualBox" &gt;nul &amp;&amp; start VBoxServic=
e.exe
   ```

